# Both optional. With neither set, Huddle runs as one process on your LAN,
# which is the only way it is meant to run.

# Port the server listens on.
PORT=4000

# Where the SQLite database and uploads live. Defaults to ./data
# HUDDLE_DATA_DIR=/var/lib/huddle

# Upload limits are deliberately not configurable — 100 MB per file and 1 GB per
# room, both in src/lib/constants.ts. An env-configurable version had to exist in
# two places (inlined into the browser bundle at build time, read by the server at
# runtime) and the two silently disagreed.
